-  right: ["             ▄     ", "█▀▀▀ █▀▀█ █▀▀█ █▀▀█", "█___ █__█ █__█ █^^^", "▀▀▀▀ ▀▀▀▀ ▀▀▀▀ ▀▀▀▀"],
